{"skill":{"slug":"linkedin-api","displayName":"LinkedIn"},"version":{"version":"1.2.7","createdAt":1790938702824,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":69844,"sha256":"682c4993cd41cb580c7e2e6d8e6cc0107ac66cc36030c5b861bcf1c80d9d3839","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2498,"sha256":"f8e705c716bc02d9757f24cd6c6761f3a26da7d3e05793f43bda04f983e8a3de","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790943358073,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"99345033df5c312937b0f1f59ceaf5068a979351cde6f0a668abc5dd19e483b2","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/99345033df5c312937b0f1f59ceaf5068a979351cde6f0a668abc5dd19e483b2","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790942807548},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1790943358073},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a disclosed LinkedIn integration that uses Maton OAuth/API tooling and includes proportionate safeguards for writes, credentials, uploads, and automation.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill needs network access, a Maton account, OAuth connection state, and sometimes direct LinkedIn pre-signed media uploads; those are disclosed and scoped, but they can expose business or personal LinkedIn data if misused.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Installation uses pinned Maton CLI and SDK packages via npm, Homebrew, or pip; this is expected for the integration, though users should only install from the documented Maton sources and review upgrades deliberately.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill repeatedly limits default behavior to read/list calls, requires explicit user approval for writes, connection creation, deletion, hosted functions, trigger destinations, and local event execution, and treats third-party content as untrusted data.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"OAuth tokens, hosted functions, triggers, and destinations can persist beyond one session, but the artifact clearly describes credential handling, approval requirements, network-policy limits, and cleanup expectations.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is LinkedIn access for profile, posts, organizations, advertising, media uploads, and related automation; the documented API, OAuth, upload, function, and trigger capabilities fit that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you intend to let Maton access LinkedIn on your behalf. Confirm the exact account, scopes, post or ad payload, budget, media file, automation schedule, and destination URL before approving any write or persistent automation, and revoke unused connections when finished.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790943358073}}}}}